Z||000000||Anders Lundin||09-05-2001||03:24 PM||||My idle Rpm is 1300 allways and the inside of the exhaust pipes are black. I think that the temperature sending unit for the engine control is broken , where is it situated?<BR>Greatful for ideas./Anders||||reg||5
